      "writtenOn": "2022-01-13T18:16:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Caveh - is the battery actually used on Brya?\n\nI see these values are copied from verbatim from the brya/battery.c file. However, the values (voltage_max, voltage_nominal, and ship mode regs) don\u0027t match the datasheets I\u0027m able to locate.\n\nThe boten battery configuration does match the datasheets I\u0027ve found.\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/aabd986c/board/boten/battery.c#63",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 5,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "58b4d4e5e20b060c82db7c35d1719c3a25502e8e",
