      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-13T19:17:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the LGC battery was used on the previous brya build.\ni don\u0027t think anyone is still using such devices.\n\nthere is one brya variant that has it in its config, but\nthat\u0027s simply because new boards start by replicating\nbrya as a starting point. i\u0027m not sure what their ultimate\nbattery selection will be.\n\nalso, brya\u0027s LGC battery config was copied from volteer\nwhere it is the sole supported battery. any discrepancies\nmay be explained there.",
      "parentUuid": "46fb39d0_70264e1a",
